 We can Classify from the Centre Which Shape is Defined. We are Planing to  Use RESNET - Residual Neural Networks or Similar to be able to argue and analyze the better  Accuracy between all of the Networks. ","topics":[],"score":217494,"global_rank":230995},{"name":"daddyofadoggy/Search_Engine_WS","owner":"daddyofadoggy","html_url":"https://github.com/daddyofadoggy/Search_Engine_WS","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":217488,"global_rank":231012},{"name":"JY1148/my-dumbbell-curls-coach","owner":"JY1148","html_url":"https://github.com/JY1148/my-dumbbell-curls-coach","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":217485,"global_rank":231054},{"name":"xinghuang-gao/Investigate_medical_appointment","owner":"xinghuang-gao","html_url":"https://github.com/xinghuang-gao/Investigate_medical_appointment","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":217481,"global_rank":231082},{"name":"temilaj/BERT-playground","owner":"temilaj","html_url":"https://github.com/temilaj/BERT-playground","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":217471,"global_rank":231139},{"name":"jnawjux/pipeline","owner":"jnawjux","html_url":"https://github.com/jnawjux/pipeline","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":217468,"global_rank":231171},{"name":"CharlesPoletowin/YCBS-273","owner":"CharlesPoletowin","html_url":"https://github.com/CharlesPoletowin/YCBS-273","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"McGill University short-term summer program--Practical Machine Learning","topics":[],"score":217468,"global_rank":231184},{"name":"abatzel/Hands_on_ML","owner":"abatzel","html_url":"https://github.com/abatzel/Hand